%description:
Tests an ICMP fragmentation-needed error for a Fast Open SYN with data in
SYN_SENT (pmtudEnabled), as the Linux script
fastopen/client/syn-data-icmp-unreach-frag-needed. The client sends 700 bytes
on its SYN (A001), and the path answers it with the error for an MTU of 800.
The client lowers its MSS to 760 and retransmits at once a bare SYN (A002),
without the data, whose MSS option announces 760, as Linux
tcp_simple_retransmit() since kernel commit c31b70c9968f. After the SYN-ACK,
the data goes in its own segment (A003).

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

sim-time-limit = 5s
*.cli_app.fastOpen=true
*.cli_app.tSend=0s
*.cli_app.sendBytes=700B
*.cli_tcp.fastopenClientEnabled = true
*.cli_tcp.fastopenClientNoCookieRequired = true
*.srv_tcp.fastopenAcceptWithoutCookie = true
*.srv_tcp.fastopenServerEnabled = true
*.*_tcp.mss = 1460
*.cli_tcp.pmtudEnabled = true
*.tcptester.script="a1 icmp 3 4 mtu 800"

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[0.001 A001] A.1000 > B.2000: S 0:700(700) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize# answering with an ICMP error
[0.003 A002] A.1000 > B.2000: S 0:0(0) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
srv_tcp: LISTEN --> SYN_RCVD  (on RCV_SYN)
[0.005 B001] A.1000 < B.2000: A S 1000:1000(0) ack 1 win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
cli_tcp: SYN_SENT --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_SYN_ACK)
[0.007 A003] A.1000 > B.2000: A 1:701(700) ack 1001 win 16384 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
PMTUD: reducing snd_mss from 1460 to 760 (reported MTU=800)
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
The SYN carried data: retransmitting a bare SYN at once
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
Tcp Header Option MSS(=760) sent
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
